	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salutem.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Pater observande, fraterque in Christo dilecte, proxime meis inieci literis articulos dom<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>ini <persName ref="p2930">Mauritii</persName>, captivi nostri in domino, ut videas accusationem atque eius <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>defensionem, compendiosam solum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Hortor illum, ut tractet paulo copiosiorem.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Proxima Mercurii, 15. octobris, cogetur, iterum coram iudicio capita <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>rationem reddere - id vix hodie; quoniam clam astuteque agunt omnia, expis<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>catus sum, eiusque rei certiorem quoque factum nostrum magistratum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quod <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>velim, sua ut authoritate intercedant; quod ni fecerint, certe de eius <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>vita metuo.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de">Es gath by uns ein gmümmel, der lantvogt welle <foreign xml:lang="la">- <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>praeter morem et vetustissimam consuetudinem, nec non privilegia oppidi -</foreign> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ander blutrichter nammen, weiss nit, wo und welche; dan er <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>fürcht, die Luterschen, als man uns nämpt, wellint im nit <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nach sym gfallen urteilen.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Quod vix, ut ex aliquibus audio, fiet; <lb xml:id="p1z13"/><foreign xml:lang="de">dan das were mit gfaaren handlen.</foreign></s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Alii quoque et varii apud <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>nos sunt de hoc negotio rumores, ob quos velim, ut serio (idem <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>captivus etiam cupit) cum dominis nostris consulibus totoque nostro sancto <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>agas senatu, ut mittant, qui negotium tractent fortiter ac fideliter.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Accepi consulem nostrum a <persName>Kama</persName> propter negotia quaedam adesse non posse.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Des wir übel manglen werdent.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Dan glingt im mit dem <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>für war, es wirt der grimmig löw noch meer understaan, i[n] <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>den rachen zuͦ bringen.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Scripsi haec per multas curas et so[lli]<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>citudines brevibus.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Longiora etiam ob infinita tua negotia, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>quibus es obrutus occupatusque, semper legere non vacat.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Raptim <lb xml:id="p1z23"/><placeName ref="l159">Frouvenfeldae</placeName> <placeName ref="l774">Tauriacorum</placeName>, 13. octobris anno 67.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Tuus d<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>editus <persName ref="p2307">Christianus Naegelinus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo domino m[agistro] <persName ref="p495">Heinricho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> pastori vigilant<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>issimo, patrique suo <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>plurimum observando.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>gen <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
